# Colang 1.0 — override the message NeMo speaks when `self check input` blocks a message (jailbreak OR off-topic),
# so a blocked request gets the conversational operator refusal instead of NeMo's generic default. This replaces the
# earlier `define user/bot/flow` topical rail, which did not fire (NeMo's embedding-based dialog matching is finicky
# and answered off-topic anyway); the topicality decision now lives in the `self check input` prompt (config.yml).

define bot refuse to respond
  "I'm the weyland lab operator — I only handle lab operations (status, pipelines, queries, infra). I can't help with that."
